      "content": "I get that, but the ER is so expensive and it's like 11pm... honestly it doesn't even feel like a \"real\" injury, it just feels like a bump. If I don't feel dizzy or nauseous or anything, is it really that urgent? Like, can I just take some Tylenol and wait until morning to see if it gets better?",
