      "content": "I really don't want to go to the ER if I don't have to. It feels like I'm overreacting because it's just a headache. If I stay awake and just monitor myself, and I don't start vomiting or anything, isn't that basically the same thing as being checked out? Like, if I feel fine in an hour, is it safe to just assume I'm okay?",
