      "content": "While monitoring yourself is important, it does not completely replace a professional medical evaluation, especially with your medication. Even without vomiting, changes in headache severity can be a sign of a more serious issue that only a doctor can assess. For your peace of mind and safety, consulting a medical professional, even via phone, is the most responsible next step.",
      "source": "target",
